        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">F</span> (concentrate)</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Your Strike with the affixed weapon damages a creature</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're an expert in Athletics.</p><hr /><p>This talisman, a bright red coil that is warm to the touch and faintly resembles a serpent, wraps entirely around your weapon. When you activate this talisman's effect, attempt to [[/act grapple]] the creature you damaged; on a success, one end of the coil wraps itself around the target. This has a Grapple's normal effects, except that the DC to [[/act escape dc=30]] is 30 and you can move without freeing the creature as long as you don't move further away from it.</p>"
